<title>SYRIA: Syria's Assad has successful prostate operation.</title>
<headline>Syria's Assad has successful prostate operation.</headline>
<dateline>DAMASACUS 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Syrian President Hafez al-Assad has undergone a successful prostate operation, his spokesman said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The president will resume his responsibilities within a few days,&quot; said presidential spokesman Joubarn Korieh.</p>
<p>No more details on the operation were available. Assad, who has previously had his appendix removed and suffered heart problems, is 66 years old.</p>
